WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.434
-Welcome back
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.968
[ Jazz cymbals play ]

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.334
What is that?

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:06.467
Oh.
Oh.

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:07.534
Hi.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:11.067
Sorry, who --
Oh, I'm sorry, who --

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.033
Who -- Who are --
Who are you?

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:15.434
♪ Well, I'm a spooky spider ♪

00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:16.834
♪ I'm a Halloween fright ♪

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:20.367
♪ With some safety tips
this Halloween night ♪

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:24.300
♪ When you go trick-or-treating,
go with a group ♪

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.667
♪ Take care not to trip
over pumpkins on stoops ♪

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.133
♪ Don't use silly strings ♪

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:31.868
♪ Never throw eggs ♪

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:35.400
♪ Take it from me
because I've got eight legs ♪

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.501
[ Laughs ]

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:41.133
Happy Halloween.

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:43.400
-I'm so sorry.
What's happening?

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:47.133
Right, spooky spider,
it's nowhere near Halloween.

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:50.167
You're either six months early
or five months late.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:52.467
-I see.

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:53.767
[ Jazz cymbals play ]

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.734
Well, in that case...

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:57.734
♪ I'm a Valentine's spider ♪

00:00:57.734 --> 00:00:59.234
♪ A spooky fright ♪

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:03.267
♪ With some dating tips
this Valentine night ♪

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:04.868
♪ Gaslighting is real ♪

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:06.601
♪ Which is why
you need boundaries ♪

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:08.334
-Stop, wait! Stop, stop!
I'm gonna stop you right there.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.434
I'm gonna stop you.
Sorry, uh, uh, spooky spider.

00:01:11.434 --> 00:01:13.667
Valentine's Day was last month.

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:15.501
-For real?
-Yeah, for real.

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:18.367
Uh, how -- how long
did it take you

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:20.000
to make your way
up to the East Coast?

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.367
Are you one of those
joro spiders?

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:22.767
-Well, let's -- let's see.

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:26.033
I remember a strong breeze
picked me up right after

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:28.234
I went to see
"Jumanji: The Next Level."

00:01:28.234 --> 00:01:30.200
-Okay.
That's 2019.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.567
[ Laughter ]
-Yep.

00:01:31.567 --> 00:01:33.334
And Biden's got his work
cut out for him

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:35.534
if he wants to win
the presidency next year.

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:37.667
-It is March 2022.

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:39.400
-Say what?
Hold on a minute.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:40.934
Let me check my --

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.467
Let me check
my T-Mobile Sidekick here.

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:45.567
-Wait.
You have a T-Mobile Sidekick?

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:48.167
-Oh, jealous?
This baby is sweet.

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:51.534
SMS text messaging,
full QWERTY keyboard,

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:53.901
1G and 3 bars.
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:57.534
-Spooky spider, I think
it's time for you to go.

00:01:57.534 --> 00:02:00.501
-Very well. I'm off to see
the new Batman movie.

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:03.133
-Oh, yeah? Robert Pattinson
is fantastic as Batman.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:04.334
-The guy in "Twilight"?

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:07.467
No, I'm talking about Affleck.
You know, Batman.

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:09.067
-All right.
Spooky spider, everyone.

00:02:09.067 --> 00:02:11.067
Enjoy.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:13.801
We'll be right back
with more "Tonight Show."

